<title>FRANCE: EU cuts wheat refund for Alpine states to one Ecu.</title>
<headline>EU cuts wheat refund for Alpine states to one Ecu.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday set a standing export refund of one Ecu per tonne for exports of soft wheat to Switzerland and Liechtenstein, French grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU had previously cut the refund to three Ecus from 6.50 Ecus last Thursday.</p>
</text>
